Subject: [PATCH 9/9] docs(temi): document managed Demo lifecycle

---
 README.TemiAgent.md | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/README.TemiAgent.md b/README.TemiAgent.md
index 6b33ac310..385024598 100644
--- a/README.TemiAgent.md
+++ b/README.TemiAgent.md
@@ -167,6 +167,18 @@ health=http://127.0.0.1:8765/health
 invoke=http://127.0.0.1:8765/invoke
 ```
 
+The canonical Demo lifecycle starts the resident from `/TemiAgent`, preloads
+the four Temi skills, and sets `HERMES_ACCEPT_HOOKS=1` only for that managed
+process. When the private Demo profile declares the Hermes gateway `managed`,
+the same lifecycle runs `hermes --accept-hooks gateway run`, records its exact
+PID identity, and stops it before Bridge shutdown. Gateway connectivity is not
+Discord delivery evidence and the lifecycle never sends a test message.
+
+The pinned Hermes context-compressor implementation derives its compression
+threshold from the active context. With the canonical 64K Demo configuration
+and the reviewed `0.50` threshold, the threshold is 32K. Resident startup
+rejects context drift before accepting requests.
+
 驗證順序：
 
 1. `curl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8765/health`
